msgid ""
"Profile / account dropdown — opened from the global top bar.\n"
"\n"
"The contents are drawn natively by `layout.mixar_profile_card()`\n"
"(`interface_mixar_profile_card.cc`): a greeting, the plan chip, the\n"
"credit usage meter and the account actions, laid out as one card\n"
"rather than a menu. Python still owns registration and every\n"
"operator the card invokes — C++ owns only pixels.\n"
msgstr ""
"Spustni meni profila/računa — odprt iz globalne zgornje vrstice.\n"
"\n"
"Vsebino izrisuje izvorno `layout.mixar_profile_card()`\n"
"(`interface_mixar_profile_card.cc`): pozdrav, značka paketa,\n"
"merilnik porabe kreditov in dejanja računa, razporejena kot ena kartica\n"
"namesto menija. Python še vedno vodi registracijo in vsak\n"
"operator, ki ga kartica kliče — C++ vodi samo slikovne točke.\n"

