msgid ""
"Create a new image (Tiled enabled by default)\n"
"\n"
"Wrapper around `image.new` that pre-sets `tiled=True` on the\n"
"operator's property dialog. Used as the `new=` operator for\n"
"`template_ID` in Mixar UV panels so the dialog opens with the\n"
"Tiled checkbox already checked. The underlying `image.new` does\n"
"the actual creation and ID assignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ustvari novo sliko (ploščenje je privzeto omogočeno)\n"
"\n"
"Ovijalnik okoli `image.new`, ki v pogovornem oknu lastnosti\n"
"operatorja vnaprej nastavi `tiled=True`. Uporabljen kot operator `new=` za\n"
"`template_ID` na ploščah UV Mixar, da se pogovorno okno odpre z že\n"
"označenim potrditvenim poljem Ploščeno. Osnovni `image.new` opravi\n"
"dejansko ustvarjanje in dodelitev ID.\n"

